Third-party data
----------------
These files under web/public/data/ are excerpts of the Sully Chen driving datasets (MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2018 Sully Chen, https://github.com/SullyChen/driving-datasets): the
two short demo clips (clips/*/clip.mp4), the clips' sprite sheets (clips/*/sprite-*.jpg),
the leakage-pair thumbnails (leakage/frame-*.jpg) and the self-test frame stacks, cut from
the 2018 clip (selftest/frames.bin). The dataset's author asks that it be used for research
and statistics only, never to pilot a vehicle; that is a request, not a term of either
licence. The ONNX models under web/public/models/ were trained on that data and are released
under this MIT licence, and this project asks the same of anyone who uses them.
